[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4562.11, "timestamp": "01:16:02", "text": "那么，哪一个是你的呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4565.03, "timestamp": "01:16:05", "text": "随着能够无差别读取事物的内存容量增加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4568.31, "timestamp": "01:16:08", "text": "并见证了许多开始和结束"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4569.95, "timestamp": "01:16:09", "text": "塔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4573.87, "timestamp": "01:16:13", "text": "所以我意识到自己有多么渺小。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4577.11, "timestamp": "01:16:17", "text": "我终于明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4580.458, "timestamp": "01:16:20", "text": "地下学院利用这些记忆来帮助我面对过去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4580.51, "timestamp": "01:16:20", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4584.75, "timestamp": "01:16:24", "text": "我重现了这个问题。那本质上是一个分数"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4587.669, "timestamp": "01:16:27", "text": "然而，作为星光学院的代表，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4591.229, "timestamp": "01:16:31", "text": "它在提一个问题。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4594.629, "timestamp": "01:16:34", "text": "面对一个没有答案的未来，一切都消失了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4597.189, "timestamp": "01:16:37", "text": "命运的力量"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4600.27, "timestamp": "01:16:40", "text": "所以，我们的行动仍然毫无意义，因为我们一无所知。"}]